# (0.31) The PC icon without polling, and Auto connect (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes
# tests/pc31.keys from this; make test-pc). emu816 --pc-folder on a copy of tests/pc, the
# link dropped at 1.5 s (after the boot's clock from the PC), back at 41 s. The PC icon is at
# (595, 160). tests/cardreq.py --count: the requests in each window. Shots (s):
#   1   6.0  the link down: the PC icon is there all the same
#   2   9.5  a double click on it (8 s): "The PC link is not connected." (one STAT /PC:)
#            Enter closes it; 10.5-25 s: no request at all (nothing looks at the link)
#   3  27.0  a right click on the PC icon: Open, -, Auto connect (not checked)
#   4  47.0  Auto connect chosen (27.5 s: /SYSTEM/PCAUTO made): STAT /PC: every 5 s while
#            the link is down (28-41 s); the link back at 41 s: the PC's clock on the status
#            (05:06); then a STAT /PC: every 5 s (48-63 s)
# tests/pc31b.src: a second start with /SYSTEM/PCAUTO on the card: Auto connect is on.
